    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Adam Heslop, London-based motion designer / 3D visualiser and creative coder working as Pixels in Progress (design, visualisation, animation, code; C4D + openFrameworks). Mid-to-senior independent: Industrial Design degree from Northumbria, ~10+ years; projects include a Massive Attack 2024-25 tour visual, Jason Bruges Studio light installations, LiDAR/point-cloud experiments. Work Status Freelance: site reads as a personal practice/studio of one (Digital, Physical, R&D, Contact sections); no employer signal. Caps 3D & motion + Creative technology match the installation/generative work. Jonathans note (Cohere tool) and Worked Together Once are his.",
